{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_005_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d7458382b1d0e9c712ca8a958e171dc1051656b1758b5bf529b5c1055bd2d220",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a490b7210bd309b0118ec91cb4403c2b2cac5d87986e9a38e8215c8e283f23",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。这是情人节的巧克力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802d462743a18f58a33b77280a0e2dbc5b7e4fd2a7185e07490a4c509b09bc20",
      "text": "情人节这种日子，不过是早已背离了原本目的的节日罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f24c811468358c0acb9f4489f9ea3070efd8979a941ca5fb1d087de854925e4",
      "text": "我本以为这种活动与我无关……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5839ec0b2e02eebaeb7644bfe5ea614128873df777e7e400731f595d3cb17d7",
      "text": "巧克力倒也有能够摄取糖分、有效恢复疲劳的一面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ee4b958d7b0858b7ec518a1f6a4722bab5e8ae6cca65e7132917b3f0766c80",
      "text": "而且，这又是你特意准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11144e50eeebe590abced87d4552be22a643d946e0a5a85c2d8afea4db0fcc91",
      "text": "这次我就心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b27cf8e4d90fb1c8c29026385f0461c0d2b3a0780ded48b91561ccafeb2ca50",
      "text": "这是……啊啊，情人节的巧克力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a57d170888d3f36599411e3490c8be45d6deb6eca8a2aefa87fcdcccc9a48a5e",
      "text": "我之前就注意到你在工作间隙偷偷摸摸的，没想到竟是在为这个做准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28264fb8ea858fce96e24567174a320800b1625e2d132640e013758f956acb7",
      "text": "不介意的话，休息的时候请用吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c432c3615671dbdb187945c7f332c59a815a6bae3d3c04fe6cbbde3062291af8",
      "text": "要是能合薰先生的口味就好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6198b528549f1ea68c5b71fb0324d3f7c92cbe777b00468989bfe2c18dfd8fc2",
      "text": "哼。情人节这种东西，不过是企业想出来的营销策略。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ad00cea5e233c3cdc89f4c4c9fe3934ebf578bcf031d2a5283b705a1c1e9206",
      "text": "借着节日的由头，引导人们去消费巧克力罢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c21863924c3adaddef0acd2f64fd31be44b636e5bd5393fc9d8c1422d6933ade",
      "text": "……唉。算了，正好训练课也告一段落了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:764548e2522b9717d702dc759acc5fb6e19bd1878fdf2b0a0abd716d437d4f95",
      "text": "这个我就心怀感激地享用了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:318cc6cbd0de767173fc2f2026221afe041f1027bc378acfbc70e4280cd7858b",
      "text": "既然收了礼，就得准备回礼才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44a98283acc97d5bfdbb5912c8b91619724c67b948de5e79cda1fd4cbfc92c70",
      "text": "虽然白色情人节似乎是日本独有的风俗，但欠着人情不还，我心里过意不去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_005_22:5_01_005_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1edab455ea45ceff69d396b8943d10eae0b0dc9291a48b1e3dd0ba1df632cc49",
      "text": "这份礼我一定会回的。你就别抱什么期待地等着吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
